<header><p class="enc-kicker">People / group</p><h1 class="enc-title">Central Powers</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Central Powers were the coalition of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/germany">Germany</a>, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/austro-hungarian-empire">Austria-Hungary</a>, the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ottoman-empire">Ottoman Empire</a> and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/bulgaria">Bulgaria</a> that fought against the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/allies">Allies</a> in the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/first-world-war">First World War</a>. Their defeat in 1918 led to the collapse of all four monarchies. For the Ottoman Empire, the alliance led to the Allied <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/occupation-of-istanbul">occupation of Istanbul</a> and the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/treaty-of-sevres">Treaty of Sèvres</a>.</p></div>
